sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Codex
    participant CLI as ytvf CLI
    participant Ledger as Provider Ledger
    participant Provider
    User->>Codex: Supplies brief, keys, and approval
    Codex->>CLI: Runs provider command with env key
    CLI->>Ledger: Check request hash and cost ceiling
    alt existing completed job
        Ledger-->>CLI: Reuse completed asset
    else existing running job
        Ledger-->>CLI: Resume polling by provider job ID
    else new approved request
        CLI->>Provider: Submit immutable provider request
        Provider-->>CLI: Provider job ID
        CLI->>Ledger: Persist job ID immediately
        CLI->>Provider: Poll with bounded timeout
        Provider-->>CLI: Completed media or failure
        CLI->>Ledger: Write sanitized receipt
    end
    CLI-->>Codex: Project-relative output path and status
    Codex-->>User: Review result
